form
    tt-tit-ap.cod-estabel            at  01
    tt-tit-ap.cod-esp                at  05
    tt-tit-ap.serie                  at  09
    tt-tit-ap.nr-docto               at  16
    tt-tit-ap.parcela                at  33
    tt-tit-ap.cod-fornec             to  44
    tt-tit-ap.transacao              at  46
    tt-tit-ap.referencia             at  51
    tt-tit-ap.dt-emissao             to  71
    tt-tit-ap.dt-vencimen            to  82
